<title>BELGIUM: Engrais Rosier H1 96 net profit up 5 pct.</title>
<headline>Engrais Rosier H1 96 net profit up 5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half 1996 earnings</p>
<p>(million Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			 79.4  vs    75.6</p>
<p>    Current pre-tax profit		132.3  vs   125.9</p>
<p>    Turnover				1,261.6  vs 1,266.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Fertiliser manufacturer S.A. Engrais Rosier said it expected full year 1996 profits to be better than the 106.8 million francs it made in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
